        "kind": "Message",
        "creation": "2026-01-01 08:51:31",
        "content": "Two Casa Rinaldi purchase orders are past their promised delivery date:\n\n| Order | Items | Promised | Days late |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| PO-2025-0412 | Bronze-cut spaghetti, 12 cases | Dec 22 | **10** |\n| PO-2025-0419 | Paccheri, 8 cases | Dec 29 | **3** |\n\n**What the policy says**\n\n- Orders more than **7 days late** earn a **5% credit note**, so PO-2025-0412 qualifies. [1](/huf/knowledge/KS-0001)\n- Notify Casa Rinaldi **in writing within 2 business days**. [1](/huf/knowledge/KS-0001)\n- A third late order this quarter triggers a supplier review. [2](/huf/knowledge/KS-0002)\n\n**Sources**\n1. [Supplier Handbook 2025, §4.2 Late deliveries](/huf/knowledge/KS-0001)\n2. [Casa Rinaldi framework agreement FA-2024-07, clause 9](/huf/knowledge/KS-0002)"
